        ("Cocoplum", "The city keeps a tidal monitoring station at the Islands of Cocoplum on the Coral Gables Waterway. A dock permit in Cocoplum Section II has to include a copy of the section's dock plan, so a hive in a dock box or piling is best handled without touching more of the structure than needed."),
        ("Gables by the Sea", "Unarmed guards work from guardhouses around the clock here. The original security district reached across into the Village of [[city:pinecrest|Pinecrest]], and in 2022 the county took up a plan to divide it into a Coral Gables district and a Pinecrest district. Tell the gate which side you live on and that a bee crew is expected."),
        ("Snapper Creek and Hammock Lakes", "Both appear on the city's list of security districts. Expect a gate or a patrol to ask who you are, so give us the name on the guard list and any vehicle rules before the visit."),
